    "tree_id": "2a6388c4ad5d72df1e08d54041c0aaffd0542884",
    "message": "Keep native Vulkan model uploads on the Linux main thread\n\nDiffusion's deferred weight loader created its own std::threads, which entered the native Vulkan driver without host libc TLS even when the outer inference request ran on main. Run the complete loader task synchronously for Linux auto/native policy and reject wrong-thread entry. Preserve embedded/Windows parallel loading and the explicit host-only export path.\n\nAdd the controlled worker failure and main-thread TLS/loader regression. Correct unknown-adapter labels and document executable launch, provider selection, and persistent configuration.",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-07T03:46:19Z",
    "author": {
      "name": "DemonBigj781",
      "email": "20097331+DemonBigj781@users.noreply.github.com"
    },
